{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b939f2e2-6cf7-80ed-addf-01348019c80a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T11:34:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilza Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:29:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Newport Recreation, this is Beth. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:29:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. Um, I had a couple questions about the class fees? Like, I heard there's a scholarship for them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We do, yes. We have a scholarship program so cost doesn't keep anybody out of a class. Is this for you or for someone else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:30:00-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It'd be for me. I'm looking at one of the winter classes, and, okay, hang on, I'm at a light. I ride a scooter to work, so I'm literally calling you at a red light? Totally not ideal, but it's my lunch hour and I'll lose the chance otherwise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, well, safe is good. Pull over if you need to. I can wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:30:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I'm stopped, it's a long one. So the scholarship, how does that work? Is there a form or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:30:39-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's an application. You fill out a short form, and it asks a little about household income so we can figure out how much help to give. You can pick it up at the recreation office or we can mail it to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:30:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it, like, the whole fee or just part of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:31:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the application. Sometimes it covers the whole class, sometimes a portion. The staff here reviews each one, and I don't want to tell you a number that's wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:31:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that makes sense. And do I have to apply before I sign up for the class, or after?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:31:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Best to do it before, so your spot is held while it's being reviewed. If you tell us which class you want when you turn it in, we'll note it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:31:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, cool. Second question, are there age limits? Like for the classes? Because I'm, um, not exactly a kid? I'm in my fifties."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you're fine. Lots of our classes are for adults, and plenty of folks your age come through. Some programs are youth only and some are seniors, but the adult ones are open to everybody over eighteen, generally. Which class were you thinking of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:32:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The, uh, the pottery one? On Thursday nights?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:32:16-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me look. Hold on one second. [pause] Yep, that one's listed as adult, so no age problem. I can't see right off how many spots are left, though. Let me check on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:32:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Oh, the light's green, hang on, I'm gonna wait till I'm on the side. [pause] Okay, I'm pulled over by the curb now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:32:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Okay, I'm back. It looks like there's still room, but it's filling. So I'd get that application in soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:32:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you mail it? I'm kind of not near the office during the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. What's the mailing address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:33:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I'd rather not say it on this call? Can I just come by after work? What time do you close?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:33:12-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's no problem. We're open until five on weekdays, so if you can make it before then, grab the form at the front desk. Or I can set one aside with your name on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd be great. It's Nilza Rocha. N-I-L-Z-A, Rocha, R-O-C-H-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:33:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Nilza Rocha. I'll put it in an envelope at the front desk with the pottery class noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:33:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And if I have more questions, can somebody call me back? It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:33:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-four. Got it. Anyone in the office can ring you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:33:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Awesome. Okay, that's everything I needed. Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:34:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome! Ride safe out there, and enjoy your lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:34:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, bye."
    }
  ],
